    ":question/problem": "The equivalent radical expression for ${({r}^{3/2})}^{1/4}$ is",
    ":question/worked-solution": "First, we apply the power rule and then we express the resulting fractional power as a radical: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{({r}^{3/2})}^{1/4} & = \\\\ {r}^{(3/2)(1/4)} & = \\\\ {r}^{3/8} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[8]{{r}^{3}}\\end{aligned}\n$$"
